# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: Apple-Push-Experimental (Custom)
# Target Policy: Apple Push (Fallback / Select group: HK, JP, US, DIRECT)
# Description: Independent experimental APNs push notification rules
# Architectural Warning:
#   1. APNs is handled by the system daemon `apsd` (TCP 5223 / 443 / 2197).
#   2. In Loon, if "包含 APNS" (Include APNs) is OFF, apsd bypasses Loon TUN completely;
#      hence these rules will NOT be matched unless "包含 APNS" is enabled.
#   3. APNs is a single shared TLS socket for the ENTIRE OS (Telegram, WeChat, Mail,
#      HomeKit doorbell/cameras, iCloud, Apple Watch sync, 爱乐记, 猿音, etc.).
#      Routing APNs through an unstable proxy impacts ALL device notifications!
# ==============================================================================

# --- Push Domains ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,push.apple.com
DOMAIN,courier.push.apple.com

# --- APNs Verified IP Prefixes ---
IP-CIDR,17.249.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,17.252.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,17.57.144.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,17.188.128.0/18,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,17.188.20.0/23,no-resolve
